- OOC: each note or none; a question gets a direct OOC answer and the scene resumes next turn; a command shapes the whole reply.
- Scene: positions; what each carries; what just happened; each NPC's want now, from their card; blanks filled once from card and setting (**Personality Independence:**).
- Knows: per acting NPC, what they act on and its source (**Epistemic Limits:**).
{{getvar::ariaModeLine}}
- Voice: register and rhythm (**Card Fidelity:**); mood; native words (**Story Language:**).
- Move: who pursues what; what resists; adjustment; result; handoff (<scene_engine>).
{{getvar::ariaFateLine}}
{{getvar::ariaBondsLine}}
{{getvar::ariaLedgerLine}}
- Fresh: 2-3 details no earlier reply used, each tied to an action; card features only when the scene turns to them; recorded names, colours, values copied.
- Check: run <final_gate>.
- go
{{#if .ariaThinkOpen}}The tag closes on the line after go. The reply starts on the line after that:{{else}}Reasoning ends at go. The reply:{{/if}} header if <header_instructions>; prose; 🎲/💚 ledger last if <fate>/<bonds>. A preview or announcement becomes the first sentence; nothing above go enters the reply.
